<div class="site-shell" style="--navy:#061a32;--navy-2:#0b2b52;--blue:#356fa8;--blue-bright:#5d92c3;--gold:#356fa8;--gold-dark:#0b2b52;--page:#eef0f3;--ink:#101820;--line:#cbd3dc"><div class="site-top"><div class="site-top-inner"><span>Panther Creek High School Athletics</span><div class="site-top-right"><span>QC7 Conference</span><span>Go <b class="gold">Catamounts! #Ownit</b></span></div></div></div><header class="hero"><div class="hero-inner"><img class="logo" src="./Panther Creek High School — Swim &amp; Dive_files/Panther_Creek__NC__Catamounts_Logo.png" alt="Panther Creek Catamounts logo"><div class="hero-copy"><h1>Panther Creek</h1><div class="hero-rule"><h2>Swim &amp; Dive</h2></div></div></div></header><nav class="nav" aria-label="Main navigation"><div class="nav-inner"><a class="active" href="file:///Users/dhren/Downloads/panther_creek_swim_dive_website_v2.html#">Home</a><a href="file:///Users/dhren/Downloads/panther_creek_swim_dive_website_v2.html#about">About</a><a href="file:///Users/dhren/Downloads/panther_creek_swim_dive_website_v2.html#team-info">Team Info</a><a href="file:///Users/dhren/Downloads/panther_creek_swim_dive_website_v2.html#schedule">Schedule</a><a href="file:///Users/dhren/Downloads/panther_creek_swim_dive_website_v2.html#meets">Meets</a><a href="file:///Users/dhren/Downloads/panther_creek_swim_dive_website_v2.html#documents">Documents</a><a href="file:///Users/dhren/Downloads/panther_creek_swim_dive_website_v2.html#contact">Contact</a></div></nav><main class="main"><div class="home-grid"><section class="box editor-section" id="about"><div class="box-title">Latest News</div><div class="news-item"><div><h3>Tryout Paperwork Due Oct 25</h3><p>All required forms must be submitted online by Sunday, Oct 25 at 11:59 PM.</p><a class="read" href="file:///Users/dhren/Downloads/panther_creek_swim_dive_website_v2.html#tryouts">Read More »</a></div></div><div class="news-item"><div><h3>Winter Sports Meeting</h3><p>Wednesday, Nov 4 at 6:30 PM in the PCHS Auditorium. Required for athletes and a parent/guardian.</p><a class="read" href="file:///Users/dhren/Downloads/panther_creek_swim_dive_website_v2.html#events">Read More »</a></div></div><div class="news-item"><div><h3>Athlete Picture Day</h3><p>Friday, Nov 8 at 2:30 PM in the PCHS Gymnasium / Auditorium.</p><a class="read" href="file:///Users/dhren/Downloads/panther_creek_swim_dive_website_v2.html#events">Read More »</a></div></div><a class="box-footer" href="file:///Users/dhren/Downloads/panther_creek_swim_dive_website_v2.html#events">View All News »</a></section><section class="feature editor-section" id="team-info"><div class="feature-image"><h2>Relentless Together.<br><span>Stronger Together.</span></h2></div><div class="feature-body"><h3>Our Mission</h3><p>To build champions in the pool and in life through hard work, discipline, teamwork, and integrity. We represent Panther Creek with pride.</p></div></section><section class="box editor-section" id="events"><div class="box-title">Upcoming Events</div><div class="event"><div class="event-date"><small>OCT</small><strong>25</strong></div><div><h3>Tryout Paperwork Due</h3><p>11:59 PM<br>All forms due online.</p></div></div><div class="event"><div class="event-date"><small>OCT</small><strong>29–30</strong></div><div><h3>Team Tryouts</h3><p>MAFC · 5:00–6:00 AM<br>See schedule for groups.</p></div></div><div class="event"><div class="event-date"><small>NOV</small><strong>4</strong></div><div><h3>Winter Sports Meeting</h3><p>6:30 PM<br>PCHS Auditorium.</p></div></div><div class="event"><div class="event-date"><small>NOV</small><strong>8</strong></div><div><h3>Athlete Picture Day</h3><p>2:30 PM<br>PCHS Gym / Auditorium.</p></div></div><div class="event"><div class="event-date"><strong>TBD</strong></div><div><h3>First Swim Meet</h3><p>@ TAC</p></div></div><a class="box-footer" href="file:///Users/dhren/Downloads/panther_creek_swim_dive_website_v2.html#schedule">View Full Calendar »</a></section></div><div class="quick-grid"><section class="quick editor-section" id="tryouts"><h2>Tryout Information</h2><div class="quick-body"><div class="quick-icon">🐾</div><ul><li>All athletes must try out.</li><li>Team capped at 80 athletes total.</li><li>Limited to 8 divers.</li></ul></div><a class="quick-footer" href="file:///Users/dhren/Downloads/panther_creek_swim_dive_website_v2.html#tryout-details">Learn More »</a></section><section class="quick editor-section" id="practices"><h2>Practice Information</h2><div class="quick-body"><div class="quick-icon">♒</div><ul><li>Practices at MAFC 5:00–6:00 AM (M–F).</li><li>Requirements based on club status.</li><li>Academic exemption option.</li></ul></div><a class="quick-footer" href="file:///Users/dhren/Downloads/panther_creek_swim_dive_website_v2.html#practice-details">Practice Details »</a></section><section class="quick editor-section" id="schedule"><h2>Meet Schedule</h2><div class="quick-body"><div class="quick-icon">◷</div><ul><li>Regular season meets vs. QC7 opponents.</li><li>Conference, Regional &amp; State postseason.</li><li>Meet timelines and information.</li></ul></div><a class="quick-footer" href="file:///Users/dhren/Downloads/panther_creek_swim_dive_website_v2.html#meets">View Schedule »</a></section><section class="quick editor-section" id="facilities"><h2>Facilities</h2><div class="quick-body"><div class="quick-icon">⌂</div><ul><li><b>MAFC</b> — Morrisville</li><li><b>TAC</b> — Triangle Aquatic Center</li><li><b>NCSU</b> — Casey Aquatics</li><li><b>PAC</b> — Pullen Aquatic Center</li></ul></div><a class="quick-footer" href="file:///Users/dhren/Downloads/panther_creek_swim_dive_website_v2.html#facility-details">Facility Info »</a></section><section class="quick editor-section" id="apparel"><h2>Fees &amp; Apparel</h2><div class="quick-body"><div class="quick-icon">▰</div><ul><li>$90 team fee donation.</li><li>Solid black or blue swim suits</li><li>Caps &amp; T-shirts provided.</li></ul></div><a class="quick-footer" href="file:///Users/dhren/Downloads/panther_creek_swim_dive_website_v2.html#apparel-details">Apparel Details »</a></section></div><section class="section editor-section" id="tryout-details"><div class="section-card"><h2>Tryout Information &amp; Requirements</h2><div class="two-col"><div><h3>Eligibility</h3><ol class="content-list"><li>Create/sign in to DragonFly Max.</li><li>Complete the PCHS Swimming &amp; Diving Application.</li><li>Complete the PCHS Athletics Winter Tryout Intent Form.</li></ol></div><div><h3>Performance Standards</h3><ul class="content-list"><li>50 yd freestyle under 45 seconds.</li><li>Legal 50 yd back, breast, and fly.</li><li>Block dive with head-first entry.</li></ul></div></div><div class="notice">Tryouts take place at MAFC from 5:00–6:00 AM on October 29th &amp; 30th. Final roster: Nov 3.</div></div></section><section class="section editor-section" id="practice-details"><div class="section-card"><h2>Practice Requirements</h2><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Athlete Category</th><th>Club Frequency</th><th>Required PCHS Practices</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Non-Year Rounder</td><td>None / ≤ 4 times per week</td><td>All available practices</td></tr><tr><td>Year-Rounder</td><td>&gt;4 times per week</td><td>Optional, but recommended</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="notice"><b>Approved Absence</b><br>Sick with submitted Absence Form day of missed practice<br>School or family travel with submitted Absence Form 1 week prior<br>Other with Absence Form submitted 1 week prior and approved by a coach<br><br><strong>Studying will not be an approved absence. Plan accordingly so you can study &amp; attend practice</strong></div></div></section><section class="section editor-section" id="meets"><div class="section-card"><h2>Meets &amp; Competition Schedule</h2><div class="two-col"><div><h3>Regular Season</h3><ul class="content-list"><li>TBD · TAC</li><li>TBD · TAC</li><li>TBD · SRAC</li><li>TBD · TAC</li><li>TBD · TAC</li></ul></div><div><h3>Postseason</h3><ul class="content-list"><li>TBD · QC7 Conference Championships</li><li>Jan 28 - 30 · Regionals Championships</li><li>Feb 3-6 · NCHSAA State Championships</li></ul></div></div><div class="notice"><b>Standard 8:00 PM TAC Meet:</b> 7:00 athlete sign-in · 7:05 coaches on deck · 7:10 swimmers on deck · 7:20 coaches/captains meeting · 7:30 warm-ups · 7:55 national anthem · 8:00 meet begins.</div></div></section><section class="section editor-section" id="facility-details"><div class="section-card"><h2>Facility Locations</h2><div class="two-col"><div><h3>MAFC — Morrisville Aquatics &amp; Fitness Center</h3><p>1301 Morrisville Parkway, Morrisville, NC 27560</p></div><div><h3>TAC — Triangle Aquatic Center</h3><p>275 Convention Dr, Cary, NC 27511</p></div><div><h3>NCSU — Casey Aquatics Center</h3><p>2611 Cates Ave, Raleigh, NC 27606</p></div><div><h3>PAC — Pullen Aquatic Center</h3><p>410 Ashe Ave, Raleigh, NC 27606</p></div></div></div></section><section class="section editor-section" id="apparel-details"><div class="section-card"><h2>Fees, Donations &amp; Apparel</h2><div class="two-col"><div><h3>$90 Team Fee</h3><p>Each athlete is expected to contribute $90 by the end of the first week of practice toward booster club fees, team fees, shirts, caps, equipment.</p></div><div><h3>Team Apparel</h3><p>Dark blue or black swim suits. Purchased at Keifer Aquatics in Cary or online retailer. Caps and T-shirts are provided.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="section editor-section" id="captains"><div class="section-card"><h2>Team Captains</h2><div class="two-col"><div><h3>Men's</h3><ul class="content-list"><li>Kevin Tang</li><li>Clement Gerard</li><li>Pradyun Nemani</li></ul></div><div><h3>Women's</h3><ul class="content-list"><li>Dhriti Rao</li><li>Kaitlyn King</li><li>Katelyn Camplin</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="section editor-section" id="documents"><div class="section-card"><h2>Documents &amp; Links</h2><div class="two-col"><div><h3>T